  "title": "Apple Watch AI Features for Conversations Begin Beta Testing",
  "summary": "Apple introduces new AI features for its Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4, including the ability to rewind conversations and summarize ambient interactions, while also prioritizing privacy concerns and balancing AI functionality with user control. Google has released an experimental AI note-taking app, Google AI Edge Foresight, that transcribes meetings and audio files completely offline, marking a shift toward on-device AI capabilities. Google introduces AI-powered voice capabilities for Gmail, Docs, and Keep, allowing users to search for emails or draft documents using the new conversational feature. Google also provides these tools for paying customers.",
